WEBVTT

00:13:59.401 --> 00:14:01.768
Unless --

00:14:01.792 --> 00:14:06.979
"unless," that most evocative
of all English words --

00:14:07.003 --> 00:14:08.466
"unless."

00:14:09.371 --> 00:14:13.804
But the "unless" word is also attached

00:14:13.828 --> 00:14:18.780
to that other, most terrifying phrase,

00:14:18.804 --> 00:14:20.693
"If only I had ..."

00:14:21.463 --> 00:14:24.167
"If only I had ..."

00:14:24.191 --> 00:14:29.437
If you ever have that thought
ricocheting in your brain,

00:14:29.461 --> 00:14:31.818
it will hurt a lot.